WEBVTT

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.150
<i>It's winter break now.</i>

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.920
<i>Christmas is over,</i>

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>and soon, it'll be my first 
New Year's since moving here.</i>

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.820
Hey!

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.290
What're you two doing?

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.770
It's Konomi-chan.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.750
Just out for a walk.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.060
I don't know how you can go 
out on a cold day like this.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:29.000
Well, I was just saying 
we should go back home.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.150
Huh? You're wearing your 
uniform on winter break?

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.710
Have you been at school?

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.740
Yeah, my club had morning practice.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.470
By "home," did you mean 
your house, Komari-chan?

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:41.430
Let's walk back together, then.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.580
What club are you in?

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.270
The wind ensemble.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.100
My school's far away,

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:50.660
so I have to get up before sunrise 
when we have morning practice.

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.650
Komari-chan, is something wrong?

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.490
Huh? Oh, just... Is that...?

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:58.740
Oh, this? It's the flute I play in my club.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:01.660
Oh, you play flute, Konomi-san?

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.260
It was either this or a clarinet.

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.460
Uh, not that... The...

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.630
When I lived in Tokyo, I took piano lessons,

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.460
but the flute sounds interesting, too.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.530
Wow, you played piano?

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.990
Are you interested in any 
instruments, Komari-chan?

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.970
Yeah. I can play a pianica.

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.810
I see!

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:26.900
Too bad.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:30.400
If you'd said you were interested in 
cell phones, I could've shown you mine.

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:34.940
Let me see your cell phone!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.410
<b>Episode 11</b>

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.410
<b>I Became a Pampered Child</b>

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.170
Look, Hotaru!

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:12.960
It's the gateway to adulthood, a cell phone!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:13.820
Yeah...

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:18.820
She seems pretty happy about this.

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.410
Sh-She sure does.

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.700
Komari-chan, there's no service out here.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:24.720
Is it that fun to play with a cell phone?

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.680
Huh? Service?

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.760
See where it says "No Service" on the screen?

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:34.440
When it says that, you can't 
make calls or send emails.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.440
No Service

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:36.560
Email...

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:40.530
Email! I know what that 
is! The "dot com" things!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.340
I want to "dot com," too!

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:45.490
I don't think you can "dot 
com" much on a cell phone...

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:48.020
Hey, so where can we "dot com"?

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:50.700
Well, it's not "dot com..."

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:54.460
But we can get a signal at 
my house. Want to go there?

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.040
You can send emails in your house?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.760
No, the signal doesn't 
reach inside the house.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:05.260
But if you stand here in the middle of the 
yard and hold up the phone like this...

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:08.820
See? There's an antenna.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.140
<b>Email!!</b>

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:13.500
I got an email from Hikage-chan.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.060
Really? What does it say?

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:19.320
Sub: Oh God

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:19.320
Oh God Oh God Oh God!
I had the most incredible
experience today! Details↓

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:22.780
I had McDonald's breakfast.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.360
What?! McDonald's breakfast?! Wow!

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.520
Out here, you have to get up early

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:30.780
and catch a train to get
McDonald's breakfast...

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.870
Tokyo's a convenient place.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:36.230
<i>Oh. We can't get McDonald's
breakfast out here...</i>

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:41.260
The only others I know here with cell 
phones are Kazuho-san and Kaede-chan.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.300
No Service

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:45.210
There's a signal at Kaede-chan's 
store, so you can use email there.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:47.470
I'll send one to Kaede-chan.

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:55.190
It's really hard to stand like 
this until a reply comes...

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:57.120
Oh, she replied fast.

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:59.660
"Need something?" she says.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.030
Oh, I wanna reply! I wanna reply!

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.420
Okay, sure.

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:07.230
Do I just write the reply in it now?

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:11.330
Yeah, I opened a reply screen, 
so just type in that.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:21.320
It won't work, Konomi-chan. This will 
only type a, ka, sa, ta, and na.

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:25.020
No, it works. If you keep 
pushing the key, it'll change.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:27.130
I see. There's a secret trick, huh?

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:31.840
Uh... How do you put a long dash?

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:35.560
Senpai, if you take too long, you might 
bother Candy Store-san while she's busy.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:38.250
Oh, right! Just a sec. I'll write it now.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:43.070
"Got your email. This is Komari."

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:46.040
There! I did it! Send!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.450
No Service

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:59.520
H-Huh? It still says "no service."

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.940
Huh? That shouldn't be right.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:05.210
No, look. The antenna's not coming up at all.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.220
Uh, maybe...

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:10.510
it has to be up higher to pick up the signal?

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:16.640
What?! I can't even reach 
a cell phone signal?!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.460
Oh, well, it was just a thought I had...

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.860
That does make the most sense, though.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:25.940
Here, I'll send it for you. Let me see.

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:28.200
It's fine! I'll do it myself!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:32.830
But if you take too long, Kaede-chan will 
put her phone down and go off somewhere.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:35.660
It'll be fine!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.190
All I have to do is jump, 
and this'll be easy!

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:44.000
Watch!

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.350
Senpai, are you okay?!

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.690
Komari-chan, did you just twist your foot?

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:04.540
Hotaru...

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.000
Pick me up.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.670
Hotaru!

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:10.900
O-Okay!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.440
I-I'll just carry you to your house for now...

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:18.260
You don't have to carry me... The email...

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:19.500
But your foot—

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.850
My foot doesn't hurt one bit!

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.940
Just help me send this email!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.080
Hang on...

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:29.170
So it wasn't your foot that 
got hurt, but your heart?

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:30.470
You get discouraged so fast...

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.890
Is this okay?

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:37.790
Y-Yeah... A little higher...

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:46.110
No Service

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:53.350
I did it! Look! I sent an email all by myself!

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:56.930
Well, if you're happy with that, then great...

00:07:56.930 --> 00:08:00.700
Still, I think you should put 
a cold pack on your foot.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.880
Yeah. Thanks, Hotaru.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:05.040
And thanks for letting me 
use your phone, Konomi-chan.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:09.250
Sure. If I'd known it would make you 
that happy, I'd have done it ages ago.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:12.530
It was my first time, 
but I managed to send an email.

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:15.700
I think I might've taken 
another step toward adulthood!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:21.520
A reply from Konomi. Let's see...

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:25.400
To: Kagayama Kaede

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:25.400
Goy your emu. Thisis Komaru

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.140
Huh?

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:34.400
<i>I can't tell her I had a cell 
phone when I lived in Tokyo...</i>

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.500
One, two, three...

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:47.410
What're you doing, Renge?

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:49.040
New Year's cards.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:52.570
I'm sending them to Nattsun, 
Koma-chan, Hotarun,

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:56.300
Nattsun's Nii-nii, Candy Store, Konomi-nee,

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.890
and Honoka-chin.

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:59.980
New Year's cards, huh?

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:02.080
I haven't written those in a while.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.050
You have to write New Year's cards.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:08.610
When I get back to Tokyo, 
I'll have a cell phone signal.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:11.110
Certificate of Commendation
First Place
Miyauchi Renge
You have submitted the winning entry
to the children's art contest.
We hereby award you with this
prize for your achievement.

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:11.110
I can just email them.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.800
I guess so.

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:18.280
What's next year's zodiac animal?

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:21.280
This is the year of the sheep,

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:24.030
and it's horse, then sheep, 
then monkey, so... The monkey.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.660
The monkey, huh?

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:27.370
By the way...

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:30.170
You're drawing on your cards?

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:34.010
Of course. You always 
draw on New Year's cards.

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:39.320
I dunno... You draw some 
weird stuff sometimes.

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:43.020
I remember when you drew my portrait once.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.620
I was standing alone in the middle,

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:49.080
and you drew a bunch of eyes all around me.

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:52.310
I drew that?

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:53.810
You did.

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:56.490
I couldn't even tell if it 
was really a portrait or not.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:02.340
Now I remember! You mean "Distress!"

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:04.530
That was the title?

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:07.460
Don't draw people's portraits 
with themes like that.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:10.320
You don't have to worry.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:13.840
I'll draw cuter monkeys 
on my New Year's cards.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.670
Really?

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:19.930
Hey, let me see.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.130
No! You can't see it while 
I'm still working on it!

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:25.720
Why not? It won't hurt anything.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:28.640
I'll show you when it's done. Wait until then!

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:33.450
But I'm worried about what my one 
and only little sister is drawing.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:35.680
So c'mon, let's see it.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.780
Hika-nee, you're acting like a bad guy.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.480
You want to see it that bad?

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:43.100
Yeah, I do.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:45.680
Okay, hold your hands up like this,

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:48.250
and say "Sosunser!"

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:51.050
"Sosunser." There.

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:54.380
No! Sosunser won't hear you like that!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:57.380
Yell louder to call Sosunser!

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.220
Sosunser!

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.980
Now if you fly up really high 
into the sky, I'll show you.

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:12.180
Sosunser!

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:13.730
That's not possible!

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:17.330
What the heck? You never intended 
to show me at all, did you?

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.440
And who's Sosunser, anyway?

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.380
A user of Sosuns.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:25.380
People call them the Sosunsers.

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:28.630
Wow, I'm glad you explained 
that. I still don't get it.

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:30.770
First off, I don't know what "Sosuns" is.

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:33.380
Okay, I'm getting bored.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.430
I think I'll go take a nap.

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.680
I'm going to make my New Year's cards.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.060
What're you doing?

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.380
Just kidding.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:29.010
No, seriously.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.970
Rage.

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:33.980
Trying to peek with binoculars won't work.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:37.120
I can see right through you.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:40.440
She's that determined not to show me?

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:42.530
Then I have no choice.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:46.280
I'll just have to use force!

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:49.880
I'm gonna look while you can't move!

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:50.550
What?!

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:54.330
I won't let you see it until I'm done drawing!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.250
Hey! Don't hang on my face!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.390
Ow...

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:18.430
Whoa! Stop, stop!

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:21.310
I get it already! Quit jabbing my collarbone!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.690
You really won't look?

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:26.360
Fine! I won't look!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.880
If you do, I'll Sosuns you again.

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:31.330
That was "Sosunsing?"

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:34.980
Jeez... You better show 
me when it's done, then.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:37.290
I keep telling you I will.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:40.030
Don't look.

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:41.380
I won't.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:50.400
I think I'll get some tea.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:17.580
Done!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.420
Oh, then I can look now, right?

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.790
It's okay.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:25.520
So what kind of weird picture did you draw?

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:29.890
That's rude. I drew a nice, 
cute, smiling monkey.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.950
Well, yes, it is smiling...

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:39.000
Huh? It's ugly, but it's 
actually pretty normal.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.310
I told you! I drew it nice and cute!

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:45.730
That's strange...

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:49.930
What was all that noise in here, you two?

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:52.040
I was drawing pictures 
on my New Year's cards.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.700
Oh? Let's see.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:57.450
For something Renge drew, 
it's so normal, it's boring.

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:03.120
Wait, wait! What'd you draw this for?

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:07.300
The year of the sheep was last year!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:15.080
Huh?

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.440
Ook, ook!

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:21.500
Baa.

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:27.000
This year is almost over.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.640
We're all ready to ring in the new year.

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:33.420
Oh, but there's still one

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:36.340
very important event left to do.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:38.400
We'll be waiting at our house tomorrow.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:39.330
Okay!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:42.580
Oh, Hotaru-chan and Renge. Heading home?

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:48.800
Koshigaya

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:46.070
Oh, sorry we stayed so late.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:48.800
There's no need to be so formal.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.510
You're so mature, Hotaru-chan.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.220
Nothing like my girls.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:56.760
Jeez, Mom. You don't have 
to compare us like that.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:59.630
Oh, no! I'm still just a kid.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:02.020
I act like a real baby with my mom.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:05.720
Acting modest like that is 
what makes you so mature.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.610
Yesterday, Komari ate sushi with...

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:10.390
...wasabi on it to seem grown-up,
with tears in her eyes the whole time.

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:13.000
I told you, don't tell her stuff like that!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.240
Thanks for having us.

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:21.510
It got pretty dark.

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:24.720
I'll walk you home, okay, Ren-chan?

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:27.670
But I live the other way. Are you sure?

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.040
No problem.

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.620
Hey, Hotarun.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:41.780
Did you open the treasure chest halfway?

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:42.600
Huh?

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.810
Nattsun's mom said you were grown-up.

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:49.510
You looked really awkward.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:52.280
I'm not that grown-up. I'm just normal.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:56.220
I really act childish in 
front of my mom, especially.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:58.540
I wish I could be more mature, really.

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:01.620
Really? I want to see.

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:04.570
I could never let you see that.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:05.710
It's embarrassing.

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:10.040
See you.

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:11.250
Bye-bye.

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:37.360
Mom, I'm home!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.420
Welcome home.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:42.120
I went to play at Senpai's house.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:44.660
We played cards today! I won lots!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:45.560
Was it fun?

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:47.280
It was super fun!

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:49.670
Hey, Mom, can I have a snack?

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:52.550
It's time for dinner. You'd better not.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.760
Aww! Just a little!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.080
All right, just a little.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:00.380
Yay!

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:04.850
What's for dinner today, anyway?

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:07.360
Your favorite, stew.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:10.270
Stew?! Never mind! I don't need a snack!

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:13.690
Stew!

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.530
Yay! We're having stew!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:18.990
I'll get some of my winter break 
homework done while dinner's cooking.

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:27.200
Yep, the Nekomari pencil holder 
I made yesterday came out great!

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:36.890
Special Program

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:36.890
<b>Cats</b>

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:36.890
<b>Everywhere</b>

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:40.560
Whew! I almost forgot about the cat special!

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:43.140
I would've missed it if not for Nekomari.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:52.560
Aww, kittens are so cute!

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:57.490
But you're even cuter, Pechi!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:59.700
Hotaru-chan, the stew's ready.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:01.340
Okay!

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:12.580
Nee-chan, what're you reading?

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:15.420
A fashion magazine.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:18.620
I'm gonna climb even higher on the 
stairs to adulthood next year.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:21.050
What's that?

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:24.730
A game. I thought we could 
all play it on New Year's.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:25.510
The Game of Life

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:26.980
Hey, Nii-chan.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.370
Hanafuda?

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.680
Classy.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.110
I'm done with the bath.

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.180
Did you cover the tub?

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:38.720
Yep, I did.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:43.320
Mom, is Dad still not home?

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:45.170
Seems like he'll be late today.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:47.290
It's already ten, so you should get to bed.

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:49.230
Aww, I don't want to!

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:51.380
I'm staying up until Dad gets home!

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:53.080
No, dear.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.750
I'm going to sleep until he gets home, too.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:59.380
Aww... Then can I sleep with you?

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.720
Of course.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:01.880
Yay!

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.700
Yay!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:07.440
Rolly rolly roll...

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.560
Goodness, Hotaru-chan, what are you doing?

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:13.100
Well, I haven't slept with you in forever!

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:18.620
I guess you're still a child, aren't you?

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:20.070
Yep, I am!

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.320
Well, goodnight!

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.640
Yes, goodnight.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:43.450
It's nice out.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:47.390
The mochi rice isn't done steaming 
yet. Hang tight a bit longer.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:49.870
Here's the amazake.

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.400
It's steaming hot.

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:01.250
By the way, Hotarun...

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:04.800
You said you act like a kid at home.

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:07.160
Do you get up in the morning by yourself?

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:10.300
Even Nee-nee can't do that.

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:13.620
Huh? Yeah, I set an alarm.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:18.380
Ren-chon, she's probably not that different 
even if she says she acts like a kid.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:21.490
All grown-ups act all modest like that.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:23.720
Oh, but really, at home I'm...

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:27.350
Oh, come on. You don't have to try so hard.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:30.220
Nee-chan could stand to 
learn from your example.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:33.020
Seriously, stop comparing us like that!

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:35.940
<i>Why don't they believe me?</i>

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.310
It's sweet!

00:21:43.310 --> 00:21:45.360
Yum!

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.830
That seemed kind of childlike.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:54.090
Huh? R-Really?

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.210
We're ready to pound the mochi.

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.920
Okay!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:16.350
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:21.480
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:43.010
<i>When the cherry blossoms bloom, 
let's go flower viewing.</i>

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:44.630
<i>That sounds great!</i>

00:23:44.630 --> 00:23:46.460
<i>Any bamboo shoots over there?</i>

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:47.700
<i>Princess Kaguya!</i>

00:23:48.170 --> 00:23:49.270
<i>That's right...</i>

00:23:50.060 --> 00:23:52.560
<i>It's been a year already.</i>

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:53.450
<b>Episode 12</b>

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:53.450
<b>A Year Passed</b>

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:55.950
<b>Non Non Biyori
Repeat</b>

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:55.950
Photo: R.T.K

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:55.950
Please Watch Again
